            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am afraid, I can not reproduce.\n\nFirst, is there a reason you have [both 'mini.completion' and built-in `vim.lsp.completion` enabled](https://github.com/swahpy/mvim/blob/36daef1a91f1c0aafa493aafcdfb6d2c052faf4c/lua/plugins/lsp.lua#L36)? This *might* result in these issues and I'd suggest using only one of them.\n\nIf removing `vim.lsp.completion` line did not help, I'd ask you for specific steps with which you can reliably reproduce the error: project structure, file name, file content, cursor position, typed text (assuming you use the linked LSP setup).",
